# Windows scripts need CRLF line endings, Unix scripts LF
*.cmd text eol=crlf
mvnw text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
.github/quarkus-ecosystem-test text eol=lf
# The build formats the Java sources with LF line endings (quarkiverse-parent) : checked out with LF on every platform,
# so that a build does not rewrite them on Windows (core.autocrlf)
*.java text eol=lf
# The libjvm stand-ins of WebKit (runtime/src/main/c/build-libjvm-stand-in.sh)
*.so binary
*.dylib binary
